    records: wdcfloodstale measured, not inferred -- three legs, and the control is the point
    
    The row was filed at BELIEVED on two independent readings plus one seat's offline measurement.
    This is my own, and it measures BOTH halves, because a death measurement without a working
    replacement is only half a finding.
    
        leg 1  1026 IDENTIFY commands through wdc_command()          ->  0 overrun messages
        leg 2  CONTROL: the same payload with NO reset between them  ->  1
        leg 3  REMEDY: the same overrun via the guest DATA PORT      ->  2
    
    *** LEG 2 IS WHAT MAKES LEG 1 A FINDING RATHER THAN A BROKEN HARNESS. ***  Without it, a 0 is
    equally explained by a harness that cannot see the message at all.  `overrun x2` in
    `regress/wdc_flood_probe.py` drives exactly leg 1's stimulus and wants the message ONCE.
    It gets none.
    
    MECHANISM: `wdc_command()` calls `wdc_new_command_reset()` unconditionally, zeroing both ring
    pointers; IDENTIFY then stages 512 bytes.  Occupancy after any command is at most 512, so 1026
    commands cannot lap a 262656-byte ring.
    
    *** AND A LIMIT IN MY OWN ORACLE, WRITTEN DOWN RATHER THAN LEFT TO READ CLEANER THAN IT IS. ***
    `stub_fatals` counts EVERY fatal(), not overruns.  So leg 3's 2 is ONE overrun plus ONE #464
    unexpected-write latch -- the data-port route arms no tenant, so that latch fires too.  It is
    not two overruns.  Legs 1 and 2 are unaffected: leg 1 produces no fatal() of any kind, and leg 2
    pushes through the primitive directly, which trips no unexpected-write latch.
    
    WHY IT IS URGENT RATHER THAN MERELY WRONG: `overrun x2` is a SCORED row in
    `gate_sh_rounding.sh`, and the weekly battery runs SUNDAYS while #479 landed on the 27th.  So
    it is not silently red -- it will go red on the NEXT battery, and whoever triggers that battery
    will attribute the red to their own change.  It is also a live clause-(b) breach for #464,
    whose ring-producer reinstatement mutant this row solely carries.
    
    DISPOSITION UNCHANGED: FILE and rank urgent, NOT fix-in-round.  It is a different round's floor,
    excluded by the round-scope rule (different detector, different semantic class) and by the
    stopping rule (not a false pass or wrong record of the round that found it).  It wants its own
    short round before Sunday.
    
    The remedy is measured working by leg 3: re-aim the stimulus at the guest data-port WRITE arm,
    which takes no wdc_command() and therefore no reset.
    
    Artifacts at regress/artifacts/wdcfloodstale/measure_20260827/.  No product code changes.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

