                            "note":  "(HELD-AWAITING-SEAT codex -- DEFANGED 2026-08-29: that seat ANSWERED on 2026-08-26, see its entry of that date.  The literal marker is broken on purpose because three tools read it functionally and a stale one makes an answered stage report as waiting.) QUOTA WALL, measured on this very panel: banner + echoed 6,167-byte brief + \"You\u0027ve hit your usage limit ... try again at Aug 22nd, 2026 12:12 PM\", payload 688 bytes. Identical signature to the earlier panel, which is what confirmed the corrected seat check. Re-fire after Aug 22.  [panel_20260817_174701]"
