                            "evidence":  "MANUAL",
                            "note":  "GO-WITH-CHANGES with two REQUIRED changes: (1) the handler must report sync failure as CHECK CONDITION -- Q2 = yes, same class as #286; (2) the detector needs both a no-fix and a with-fix arm, or it cannot show it can fail.  [panel_20260817_215052]"
