                            "note":  "PACKET. Flush+fsync all DIRTY files, report failure to the guest, one command this round -- and, unprompted and exactly right, \u0027detector must write \u003c= one stdio buffer then _exit\u0027, which is precisely the boundary the measure seat later defeated with nblk 4-\u003e16.  [panel_20260817_215052]"
