                            "verdict":  "NOT-A-BUG",
                            "evidence":  "BELIEVED",
                            "note":  "PACKET, AND WRONG, recorded because the disagreement was settled by measurement rather than vote: it reported a NULL deref in fatal(d-\u003eid) \u0027if d is NULL\u0027. CHECKED -- diskimage_scsicommand has a `d == NULL` guard BEFORE the switch, so the handler is never reached with d NULL. opus5 independently reached the same conclusion. A file-blind seat cannot see a guard 24 lines above the code it is shown.  [panel_20260818_095322]"
                        },
