                            "note":  "PACKET. SHIP-WITH-CHANGES: the continue is correct but under-documented, and Q2 needs a guest-visible regression check. Both fair -- the comment WAS overclaiming (opus5 measured why) and no guest boot was run against the status change.  [panel_20260818_095322]"
                        },
                        {
                            "phase":  "review",
                            "seat":  "minimax",
                            "date":  "2026-08-18",
                            "verdict":  "REAL",
                            "evidence":  "BELIEVED",
                            "note":  "PACKET. Flags the new fatal() in the handler as scope creep -- \u0027rename to warning() or commit to exit-and-delete-the-dead-check_condition\u0027. Not adopted: the fatal() is the #134 diagnostic being preserved, and the CHECK CONDITION beside it is the reported half. Worth recording as a dissent rather than silently dropping.  [panel_20260818_095322]"
