                            "note":  "*** SEAT DID NOT ANSWER, AND THE CAUSE IS A DEFECT IN MY BRIEF, NOT IN THE SEAT. *** CLAUDE.md records that a brief containing a read-the-source instruction GUARANTEES a stall from minimax and deepseek, and that it will look exactly like a quota failure. My pass-2 brief line 40 says \u0027**Check that warrant against the actual files rather than trusting it here.**\u0027 -- the documented trigger, written by me, in a brief sent to a packet-fed seat that cannot read files. It began exactly as the rule predicts and stopped. Recorded as a SEAT FAILURE with the cause named, never as agreement. **The remedy is the existing rule: inline every fact a cloud seat needs and open with \u0027do not plan to read files\u0027.** The same brief did NOT stall deepseek, so the trigger is probabilistic rather than deterministic -- which is worth noting, because a rule stated as a guarantee and observed to fire once in two is a rule whose strength is overstated."
