                            "note":  "*** I CLOSED THESE AND THE GATE REFUSED, AND ON RE-READING THE GATE HAS THE BETTER ARGUMENT. ***  I set them closed on the strength of the fix shipping and gating; section H answered CLOSED-WHILE-HELD because the flagship review is held. But the stronger reason is one the gate could not know and I should have: THE ROUND\u0027S OWN PASS 2 FOUND AN UNFIXED DEFECT IN IT. codex\u0027s \u0027the latch is never consumed\u0027 is real, verified in source, and is being fixed in the pitflip round -- so #439 is not finished, and marking it closed would have recorded a round as complete on the same day its review said otherwise. Reverted to in-work. The fix stands, is gated, and is not a regression; only the CLOSURE waits.",
