                            "note":  "PANEL panel_20260825_000248 -- IT MEASURED, and the result overturns a ruling I had recorded as settled. *** THE PREDICATE IS WORSE THAN HANG-BLIND: `alive == True` FOR A PROCESS THAT HAS ALREADY BEEN SIGKILLED. *** `rd()`\u0027s loop is `while time.time() \u003c end:`, so a death landing AFTER the last budget check is never read. `alive` does not mean `hung but not exited` -- **it does not even mean `not exited`.** Four measured branches on a rig built from the SHIPPED session()/rd() (slice sha256 recorded), with controls in both directions: untouched -\u003e alive True, row ok; SIGKILL at t+2 -\u003e alive False, row FAIL (so the rig CAN go red -- not a stuck-green artefact); guest `bra .` with NO SIGNALS AT ALL -\u003e alive True, row GREEN; SIGSTOP -\u003e alive True, row GREEN. *** AND THE #462 CARVE-OUT\u0027S WARRANT IS MEASURABLY FALSE, WITH A SHIPPED INSTANCE. *** The ruling was that three rows are correctly covered because their predicate `computes nothing but liveness, making a non-lethal kill impossible`. It computes `no EOF/OSError was observed inside a budget window`. The instance is THIS ROUND\u0027S OWN M11: table2 records `nodata stale died`, table3 records `survived`, SAME session, SAME command list. It re-synced a scratch tree byte-identical to SEC, rebuilt, reproduced the baseline green, applied the one-line edit and ran that session FIVE TIMES: **5/5 deterministic SIGSEGV**, preceded by `Transfering 408 bytes to 0x00000000 (guest asked for 0)`. **So the shipped table3 M11 entry records `survived` for a session that did not reach `print r2`** -- and the probe\u0027s own contract lists TWO candidate causes for that `absent` firing, omitting the one a clean rebuild reproduces: A HOST DEATH THE PREDICATE MISSED. *Honest limit it stated itself: table2\u0027s tree is not recorded in the artifacts, so it cannot assert both shipped runs used identical binaries.* **BOUNDING IT, because the gap is narrower than `the detector is hang-blind`: 45 of 58 rows carry a positive oracle a silent session breaks (42 redden, 3 RAISE). The detector is hang-MISATTRIBUTING, plus two genuinely blind rows.**"
