                            "ev":  "_scratchpad/fable_adj_20260902 (Agent seat, model self-declared claude-fable-5)",
                            "outcome_note":  "FABLE ADJUDICATION (hold expired 2026-09-02, first firing).  *** IT FOUND THE WRONG PREMISE IT WAS ASKED TO LOOK FOR, AND THE REFUTATION WAS IN THIS PROJECT\u0027S OWN RECORDS, FILED TWO DAYS EARLIER, IN THE FILE I APPENDED TO THE SAME NIGHT. ***  My brief and this row both said TEN live width kills with reachability \u0027evidenced end to end\u0027.  OUTSTANDING_BUGS.md (2026-08-30, widthkillclass, codex, mechanism verified) says: \u0027It is now checked: 5 of the 10 width anchors are guest-reachable.\u0027  An aligned non-byte m88k access can never carry an ODD relative_addr, and %= PCC2_SIZE (0x40) keeps odd offsets odd in all 64 aliases -- so seven of the twelve guarded registers are UNREACHABLE BY CONSTRUCTION (VECBASE, PSCALEADJ, T1CTL, T1ICR, SCCICR, SCCRX, SCSIICR) and five are reachable (GENCTL 0x02, T2CTL 0x16, T2ICR 0x1a, SCCERR 0x1c, SCCTX 0x1e).  VERIFIED HERE by opening the file.  The row stays HIGH -- the GENCTL halfword kill is real and live -- but a round record claiming \u0027ten guest-reachable kills\u0027 would be a WRONG RECORD, and the five unwitnessable arms must be recorded as \u0027reachability REFUTED at OB:widthkillclass\u0027, never left as blanks.  *** THIS IS THE CARRIER\u0027S OWN GREP-YOUR-OWN-FINDINGS RULE FAILING IN PRACTICE: a warrant checked only against the facts in hand, defeated by a fact I already held under another label. ***",
                            "note":  "FABLE ADJUDICATION (hold expired 2026-09-02, first firing).  *** IT FOUND THE WRONG PREMISE IT WAS ASKED TO LOOK FOR, AND THE REFUTATION WAS IN THIS PROJECT\u0027S OWN RECORDS, FILED TWO DAYS EARLIER, IN THE FILE I APPENDED TO THE SAME NIGHT. ***  My brief and this row both said TEN live width kills with reachability \u0027evidenced end to end\u0027.  OUTSTANDING_BUGS.md (2026-08-30, widthkillclass, codex, mechanism verified) says: \u0027It is now checked: 5 of the 10 width anchors are guest-reachable.\u0027  An aligned non-byte m88k access can never carry an ODD relative_addr, and %= PCC2_SIZE (0x40) keeps odd offsets odd in all 64 aliases -- so seven of the twelve guarded registers are UNREACHABLE BY CONSTRUCTION (VECBASE, PSCALEADJ, T1CTL, T1ICR, SCCICR, SCCRX, SCSIICR) and five are reachable (GENCTL 0x02, T2CTL 0x16, T2ICR 0x1a, SCCERR 0x1c, SCCTX 0x1e).  VERIFIED HERE by opening the file.  The row stays HIGH -- the GENCTL halfword kill is real and live -- but a round record cGS RULE FAILING IN PRACTICE: a warrant checked only against the facts in hand, defeated by a fact I already held under another label. ***"
