                            "grade":  "CONFIRMED",
                            "outcome":  "ADJUDICATED",
                  tcome_note":  "RULING -- Q1.1 DIRECTION SPLIT: **YES**, and the seat supplied a stronger warrant than my brief had.  Decisive fact, verified: wide reads spanning GENCTL/VECBASE are ALREADY ACCEPTED TODAY when the base offset lands on an unchecked arm -- a word read at 0x00 (CHIPID) returns those same bytes through the top-of-function memcpy with no kill.  The identical bytes flow or kill depending only on which case label the base hits, so the read-side kill defends nothing that is not already served one offset away.  And no arm computes a read value, and arms break to `return 1\u0027 with no common read tail, so an early decline cannot skip anything (the sketch-rule hazard does not apply).  Writes land ONLY inside arms, so a write decline is honest.  READS: delete the kill, keep the value, NO latch -- there is no event to announce.  WRITES: decline + latched announce.  *** AND THE FILE ALREADY HOLDS FOUR WIDTH DISPOSITIONS, NOT TWO: the timer block accepts wide writes by memcpy, SCCRXIACK ignores len entirely, #119\u0027s IPL/MASK decline, and the unchecked-arm accept above.  My \u0027two dispositions\u0027 framing undercounted. ***",
                            "note":  "RULING -- Q1.1 DIRECTION SPLIT: **YES**, and the seat supplied a stronger warrant than my brief had.  Decisive fact, verified: wide reads spanning GENCTL/VECBASE are ALREADY ACCEPTED TODAY when the base offset lands on an unchecked arm -- a word read at 0x00 (CHIPID) returns those same bytes through the top-of-function memcpy with no kill.  The identical bytes flow or kill depending only on which case label the base hits, so the read-side kill defends nothing that is not already served one offset away.  And no arm computes a read value, and arms break to `return 1\u0027 with no common read tad announce.  *** AND THE FILE ALREADY HOLDS FOUR WIDTH DISPOSITIONS, NOT TWO: the timer block accepts wide writes by memcpy, SCCRXIACK ignores len entirely, #119\u0027s IPL/MASK decline, and the unchecked-arm accept above.  My \u0027two dispositions\u0027 framing undercounted. ***"
                        },
                        {
                            "seat":  "fable5",
                            "phase":  "assess",
