                            "grader":  "mainloop -- each checkable claim re-derived by opening the file, not transcribed",
                            "ev":  "_scratchpad/fable_adj_20260902 (Agent seat, model self-declared claude-fable-5)",
                            "outcome_note":  "RULING -- Q1.2 ADDITION LICENCE: **SATISFIED, but cite the RIGHT warrant.**  NOT #119\u0027s func shape.  *** MINIMAX\u0027S SINGLE-INSTANCE OBJECTION IS REAL AND INVERTED: single-instance means field-vs-static has ZERO measurable delta, so the licence CANNOT PREFER THE STATIC; and the tiebreaker is that every new `static\u0027 adds two rows of filed staticlatchscope debt while a field adds none.  Single-instance is also a LAYOUT FACT, not an invariant -- one device_add today, multi-machine configs are legal. ***  DEEPSEEK\u0027S convert-the-#119-statics: **NO** -- that is staticlatchscope\u0027s scope, and converting here widens the diff into unreviewed code for zero measured benefit.",
                            "note":  "RULING -- Q1.2 ADDITION LICENCE: **SATISFIED, but cite the RIGHT warrant.**  NOT #119\u0027s function statics.  The in-tree exempe, not transcribed",
                            "ev":  "_scratchpad/fable_adj_20260902 (Agent seat, model self-declared claude-fable-5)",
                            "outcome_note":  "OWED BY THE ROUND, from the same adjudication: (a) the CONTRACT must state the 5-reachable/7-unreachable split rather than claim ten; (b) a rung-3 witness is BUILDABLE and should be attempted before recording documented-only -- planted m88k halfword load at 0xfff42002 on mvme187, pre-fix symptom is process exit, with VECBASE\u0027s nonzero reset (0x0f) as the device-signature control; (c) FLAGGED NOT ASSERTED by the seat, and the round owes an answer: whether any real mvme187 driver performs the wide WRITES the decline will refuse.  Its own words: \u0027that is a reading, nobefore recording documented-only -- planted m88k halfword load at 0xfff42002 on mvme187, pre-fix symptom is process exit, with VECBASE\u0027s nonzero reset (0x0f) as the device-signature control; (c) FLAGGED NOT ASSERTED by the seat, and the round owes an answer: whether any real mvme187 driver performs the wide WRITES the decline will refuse.  Its own words: \u0027that is a reading, not a measurement\u0027."
