                        {
                            "seat":  "fable5",
                            "phase":  "research",
                            "d":  "N/A",
                            "date":  "2026-09-03",
                            "grade":  "CONFIRMED",
                            "outcome":  "GO-WITH-CHANGES",
                            "grader":  "mainloop (claude-fable-5-1) -- *** SELF-GRADED: author self-review, badge A ***",
                            "ev":  "_scratchpad/panel_20260903_093835",
                            "outcome_note":  "Self-dec SEVEN ODD ARMS ARE OPERATOR-REACHABLE: debugger_cmds.c warns on a misaligned put and then STORES, through memory_rw to the handler. Fix all identically; contract states 5 guest-reachable / 7 operator-reachable. *** IPL is at 0x3e (EVEN) -- its #119 arm is guest-reachable and prints ignored about a read the memcpy already served; fold IPL/MASK in (12 bits). Corrected its OWN 2026-09-02 ruling in three places. Unnamed option member: COMPOSE (per-lane dispatch), with the hazard that it must live INSIDE the arms. C040 kill (legal byte write 0x04 to GENCTL -\u003e exit) has no ledger row. Ten arms / twelve labels. ALL SIX CHECKABLE CLAIMS VERIFIED BY THE MAIN LOOP.",
                            "note":  "Self-declared claude-fable-5-1 (a claim). *** THE TREE ALREADY KNEW WIDE ACCESS IS LEGAL: mvme_pcctworeg.h:9-10 says PCC2 registers can be accessed as 8/16/32 bits -- neither the brief nor the 2026-09-02 adjudication cited it. Refutes FAULT; reframes DECLINE as refusing a hardware-legal access. *** DELETE is measurably WRONG for writes: memory_readmax64 composes big-endian so (uint8_t)idata is the HIGHEST-address lane -- st.h 0xAABB to GENCTL would store VECBASE\u0027s byte. Mandatory mutant + readback row. *** THE SEVEN ODD ARMS ARE OPERATOR-REACHABLE: debugger_cmds.c warns on a misaligned put and then STORES, through memory_rw to the handler. Fix all identically; contract states 5 guest-reachable / 7 operator-reachable. *** IPL is at 0x3e (EVEN) -- its #119 arm is guest-reachable and prints ignored about a read the memcpy already served; fold IPL/MASK in (12 bits). Corrected its OWN 2026-09-02 ruling in three places. Unnamed option member: COMPOSE (per-lane dispatch), with the hazard that it must live INSIDE the arms. C040 kill (legal byte write 0x04 to GENCTL -\(claude-fable-5-1) -- *** SELF-GRADED: author self-review, badge A ***",
                            "ev":  "_scratchpad/panel_20260903_093835",
                            "outcome_note":  "Ten blocks covering twelve labels. Precedent argument AGAINST fixing the odd arms: OB sgirekills says an unreachable terminating site must not be fixed without an executable row -- BUT that case was a dead else-arm no input can reach, a different species from arms the debugger reaches; the operator-reach measurement decides it. Do NOT copy #497\u0027s 1\u003c\u003cN enum mechanically (the fork records it as collision-prone); use auto-increment + NBITS. Full decline-side row set: pre/post byte snapshots, one message per fresh instance, same-site-twice, five sites once each, TWO INSTANCES -\u003e two messages to distinguish per-instance from static. Two separate findings: the counter arm accepts 8-byte writes that raw-copy through PSCALE and both timer-control bytes; valid aligned wide starts at 0x14/0x18/0x2c hit the default kill (-\u003e pcc2defaultkill).",
