                            "outcome_note":  "Self-declared claude-fable-5-1 (a claim). *** THE TWO FOLDED-IN ARMS HAD NO ROW: the probe touches no offset at 0x3e or 0x3f -- twelve blocks converted, ten given rows, undisclosed in the shipped contract. MASK is GENCTL\u0027s byte-identical twin; GENCTL\u0027s null-repair is caught by rb genctl, MASK\u0027s by nothing -- an operator-reachable 60/60 sweep. AND IPL IS EVEN: the SIXTH guest-reachable block, not a seventh operator one; a verbatim kill there is guest-reachable and uncaught. Sibling parity firing exactly where designed. *** Q1: read-ACCEPT correct for all twelve (IPL\u0027s read-side IPL==0 latch still correct, width-independent). Q3: put h -\u003e store_16bit_word -\u003e ONE memory_rw(len 2) -\u003e the SAME device guard a guest hits; \u0027operator-reachable\u0027 is right. Q4: DECLINE-now right; COMPOSE would fabricate lane semantics not on disk. Detector claims verified (60 rows, C040 clear, ld.bu/ld.hu). ACCEPTED: L2, repaired in-round.",
