                            "outcome_note":  "THE BUILDER. 11 sentinel-verified probe runs in a scratch clone of build/ at b78bb0f (dev_pcc2.c md5 4c0cfc6d... = the git blob), no project tree written, probe md5 unchanged start to end. BASE 60/60. SIX CLEAN SWEEPS of the shipped 60-row detector, all inside clause (d): M1 latch-bit ALIAS SCCTX-\u003eSCCRX (ONE character) 60/60; M2 MASK `len \u003e 2\u0027 60/60; M6 MASK announce-then-fall-through 60/60; M7 verbatim exit(1) at IPL (GUEST-reachable, 0x3e is even) 60/60; M8 guard deleted at SCCTXunce-then-fall-through 60/60; M7 verbatim exit(1) at IPL (GUEST-reachable, 0x3e is even) 60/60; M8 guard deleted at SCCTX 60/60; M9 guard deleted at MASK 60/60. Non-equivalence proven for the aliases (collide 1 vs 2) and MASK (reads back 0xbb vs 0x0, then blocks plus seven LABELS; IPL/MASK in neither list; the probe was built from that census; `latch two\u0027 pins 1 of 66 collisions; NO PRETABLE.out for table 1 while the class sat in sgideprimop\u0027s PRETABLE 33 h earlier and the d-\u003ewarned design was transferred from that very file. ITS CLASS CLOSER: `latch all\u0027 (one wide write per BLOCK, twelve announces) -- measured 12/12 on the fix, 11/12 on M1 (SILENT: SCCRX), 11/12 on M9 (SILENT: MASK); kills M1/M2/M6/M7/M8/M9 and is the only row reaching IPL/MASK. Q1 read-ACCEPT right for all twelve (IPL\u0027s read-side diagnostic RESTORED by the fix; one operator-only zero-fill exception at 0x3f). Q3 contract partly honest: three gaps undisclosed (IPL/MASK, 1-of-66, SCCTX value). Q4 DECLINE right, warrant weaker than implied: no mvme187 boot exists here, so \u0027no measured driver\u0027 had no measurement. Two L4s: census still said five even blocks; \u0027six of them calling reassert\u0027 is five of the eight (measured here: seven of the twelve blocks).wn yield (an operand swap to `idata \u003e 0xff\u0027). Own errors recorded by the seat: the heredoc backslash trap on M7\u0027s first build; a restore checker aimed at a moving worktree, caught before it fired."
