              uncommitted at the time of writing; commit follows). Twelve width-guard blocks -\u003e direction split: reads ACCEPT (the memcpy above the switch already served them; the tree\u0027s own header says wide access is LEGAL), writes DECLINE + per-instance 12-bs (part 13 M_HUHV 249/251; the rbq rows strengthen the channel, L4 + coverage, not L2), the INT-set/count-0 cell awaits M_ZINT -\u003e PASS 13 owed: 9 rows (242 -\u003e 251), 7 mutants, gate, panel.  Astra dissents on the floor bound (Opus strength-t); theows -\u003e 269, 8 mutants, PRETABLE_pass14, plus a pre-repair breach witness part14pre) and runs after the pcc2defaultkill fix ships (owner priority: critical first).",
