title: wdcaddtoinbufbound  the ATAPI data-port WRITE arm has no phase guard, so a guest can inject bytes into a live DATA-IN transfer and desynchronise the next 32768-byte chunk
state: in work
commits: ae68e29
closure: {'badge': '', 'by': '', 'note': ''}
